        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 401-305, 12 Inch Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Back-to-Back Pulls feature an easy to grip rectangular pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. The Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean modern look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12 Inch Modern Rectangular Offset Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 11-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\" x 1/2\" Rectangular</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-1/4\" to 3\" thick.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-401-305-specifications.pdf?v=1691093354\"><b>AHI 401-305 12\" Rectangular Offset Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
